CM_ SG_ 131 STS_SENSOR_MOUNT_ORNT_PITCH "Correction of the mounting position orientation w.r.t. the optimal orientation";
CM_ SG_ 131 STS_SENSOR_HEIGHT "Radar height from ground to center of radar elevation field-of-view";
CM_ SG_ 131 STS_DET_DBC_BASE_VER_MINOR "Detection base dbc Minor version";
CM_ SG_ 131 STS_DET_DBC_BASE_VER_MAJOR "Detection base dbc Major version";
